            <li style="margin: 10px 0px 0px 22.5px">Updated 27-Apr-2023
            <li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.5px">(1) Bugfixes
            <li style="list-style-type:none"><br>
			<li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.5px"><i class="fa-li fa fa-file"></i><a href='finemap_v1.4.1_MacOSX.tgz' target="_blank"><b>finemap_v1.4.1_MacOSX.tgz (Mac OS X)</b></a></li>
			<li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.5px"><i class="fa-li fa fa-file"></i><a href='finemap_v1.4.1_x86_64.tgz' target="_blank"><b>finemap_v1.4.1_x86_64.tgz (Unix)</b></a></li>
            <li style="margin: 10px 0px 0px 22.5px">Updated 04-Mar-2022
