            <li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.5px">Mac OSX users: If you see <span class="box-grey" style="font-family: 'Inconsolata'; font-weight: normal">dyld: Library not loaded: /usr/local/lib/libzstd.1.dylib</span>, install <a href='https://facebook.github.io/zstd/' target="_blank">Zstandard</a>.
            <li style="list-style-type:none"><br>
            <li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.5px"><i class="fa-li fa fa-file"></i><a href='finemap_v1.2_MacOSX.tgz' target="_blank">finemap_v1.2_MacOSX.tgz (Mac OS X)</a></li>
			<li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.5px"><i class="fa-li fa fa-file"></i><a href='finemap_v1.2_x86_64.tgz' target="_blank">finemap_v1.2_x86_64.tgz (Unix)</a></li>
            <li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 22.5px"><i class="fa-li fa fa-book"></i><a href='index_v1.2.html' target="_blank">Documentation</a></li>
